      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KHUSUS AKTA CUKAI PENDAPATAN 1967 Pindaan seksyen 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "III",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III__cl_26",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III__cl_27"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PERUNTUKAN KHAS Anggaran cukai yang kena dibayar bagi tahun taksiran 2004"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bagi tahun taksiran 2004 anggaran cukai yang kena dibayar berkenaan dengan sesuatu badan amanah atau koperasi yang dikemukakan kepada Ketua Pengarah di bawah subseksyen 107c(2) Akta ibu tidak boleh kurang daripada amaun cukai yang kena dibayar bagi tahun taksiran 2002 atau, jika cukai yang kena dibayar itu belum lagi ditentukan, cukai yang kena dibayar bagi tahun taksiran 2001. Peruntukan khas berhubung dengan subskesyen 21(3)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Walau apa pun peruntukan subseksyen 21(3) Akta ibu, jika seseorang, selain suatu syarikat, badan amanah atau koperasi, telah menyusun akaun perniagaannya untuk tempoh dua belas bulan yang berakhir pada suatu hari selain 31 Disember dalam tahun asas 2001, dan terdapat kegagalan untuk menyusun akaun perniagaan itu berakhir pada hari yang bersamaan dalam tahun asas yang berikutnya, tempoh yang bermula pada hari selepas berakhirnya tempoh dua belas bulan itu sehingga hari yang bersamaan itu hendaklah menjadi tempoh asas bagi tahun taksiran 2002 bagi perniagaan orang itu."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 86 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \" Return by 86. (1) Where a business is carried on by a partner- partnership— ship. (a) the precedent partner, that is to say, the partner who, being an acting partner present Malaysia— (i) is first named in the partnership agreement; or (ii) if there is no partnership agreement, is specified by name or initial singly or with precedence to the other partners in the usual name of the firm; or (b) if no acting partner is present in Malaysia, any attorney, agent, manager or factor of the partnership in Malaysia, shall for each year of assessment furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form not later than 30 April in the year following that year of assessment. (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), a return for a year of assessment shall— (a) specify the divisible income or the divisible loss as ascertained under the appropriate provisions of sections 55, 56, 57, 58 and 59 in relation to the partnership for that year; (b) contain such information as is necessary to determine the statutory income from all sources of the partners of the partnership; and (c) contain such other information as may be required by the Director General. (3) If a partnership has been dissolved as to all its partners, this section shall continue to apply in relation to the dissolved partnership, and those persons who were partners of the partnership immediately before the dissolution shall be deemed to continue to be partners for the purposes of this section.\". Pindaan seksyen 90"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 90 dengan seksyen yang berikut: 90. ( 1) Where a person has furnished a return in accordance with section 77 or 77A to the Director General for a year of assessment, the Director General shall be deemed to have made, on the day on which the return is furnished, an assessment in respect of that person in the amount of tax on the chargeable income, the tax and the chargeable income being the respective amounts as specified in the return."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this Act, where the Director General is deemed to have made an assessment under subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "the return referred to in that subsection shall be deemed to be a notice of assessment; and Cukai Pendapatan (Pindaan) 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "the deemed notice of assessment shall be deemed to have been served on the person on the day on which the Director General is deemed to have made the assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Where a person for a year of assessment has not furnished a return in accordance with section 77 or 77A, the Director General may according to the best of his judgment determine the amount of the chargeable income of that person for that year and make an assessment accordingly: Provided that the making of an assessment in respect of a person under this subsection shall not affect any liability otherwise incurred by that person by reason of his failure to deliver the return.\". Pindaan seksyen 93"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 93 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"90(1A)\" dengan perkataan \"90(1)\". Pindaan seksyen 96"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 96 Akta ibu dipinda —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"90(lA)\" dengan perkataan \"90(1)\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (4)(c)(ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"103(4), 103(5A), 103A(6) or 103A(7)\" dengan perkataan \"103(5), (6), (7) or (8)\". Pindaan seksyen 96A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 96A Akta ibu dipinda —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (1)(a), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"77(1A)\" dengan perkataan \"77A(1)\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (l) (b), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"77(2) or (3)\" dengan perkataan \"77(3)\". Pindaan seksyen 103"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 103 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \""
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "103. (1) Except as provided in subsection (2), tax payable under an assessment for a year of assessment shall be due and payable on the due date whether or not that person appeals against the assessment. (2) Where an assessment is made under section 90(3), 91, 92 or 96A, or where an assessment is increased under section 101(2), the tax payable under the assessment or increased assessment shall, on the service of the notice of assessment or composite assessment or increased assessment, as the case may be, be due and payable on the person assessed at the place specified in that notice whether or not that person appeals against the assessment or increased assessment. (3) Where any tax due and payable under subsection (1) has not been paid by the due date, so much of the tax as is unpaid upon the expiration of that date shall without any further notice being served be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the tax so unpaid, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act. (4) Where the tax due and payable has been increased under subsection (3), any balance remaining unpaid upon the expiration of sixty days from the due date shall without any further notice being served be further increased by a sum equal to five per cent of the balance unpaid, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act. (5) Subject to subsection (7), where any tax due and payable under subsection (2) has not been paid within thirty days after the service of the notice, so much of the tax as is unpaid upon the expiration of that period shall without any further notice being served be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the tax so unpaid, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act. (6) Where the tax due and payable has been increased under subsection (5). any balance remaining unpaid upon the expiration of sixty days from the date of such increase shall without any further notice being served be further increased by a sum equal to five per cent of the balance unpaid, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act. (7) Where any tax is payable in accordance with subsection (2), the Director General may allow the tax to be paid by instalments in such amounts and on such dates as he may determine and in the event of default in payment of any one instalment on the date specified for payment the balance of the tax then outstanding shall be due and payable on that date and shall without any further notice being served be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of that balance, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act. (8) Where the tax due and payable has been increased under subsection (7), any balance remaining unpaid upon the expiration of sixty days from the date of such increase shall without any further notice being served be further increased by a sum equal to five per cent of the balance unpaid, and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act. (9) Notwithstanding the foregoing subsections, where tax due and payable is increased by a sum under subsection (3), (4), (5), (6), (7) or (8), the Director General may in his discretion for any good cause shown remit the whole or any part of that sum and, where the amount remitted has been paid, the Director General shall repay that amount. (10) Where section 45(2) applies for a year of assessment, the portion of the tax charged for that year upon the husband or the wife in whose name the assessment was made which is attributable to the total income for that year of the wife who elects or the husband who elects, as the case may be, may, if necessary, be collected from the wife who elects or the husband who elects; and this Part shall apply (with any necessary modifications) as if, on the day on which a notice of assessment or a notice of increased assessment for that year is served on the husband or the wife that notice of assessment or notice of increased assessment had been served on the wife who elects or the husband who elects, as the case may be: Provided that nothing in this subsection shall be construed as conferring on the wife who elects or the husband who elects, as the case may be, any right of appeal under section 99. (11) For the purposes of subsection (10), the part of the tax charged for a year of assessment upon the husband or the wife which is attributable to the total income for that year of the wife who elects or the husband who elects, as the case may be, shall be determined in accordance with the formula— where— (a) in the case of the wife who elects— A is that wife's total income for a year of assessment; B is the aggregate of the husband's and that wife's or wives' total income; and C is the tax charged for the year of assessment where section 45(2)(a) applies; or (b) in the case of the husband who elects— A is that husband's total income for a year of assessment; B is the aggregate of the wife's and that husband's total income; and C is the tax charged for the year of assessment where section 45(2)(b) applies. (12) For the purposes of this section, \"due date\" means— (a) in the case of a company, trust body or co-operative society the last day of the sixth month from the date following the close of the accounting period; and (b) in any other case, 30 April in the year following the year of assessment.\". Pindaan seksyen 103A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 103A. Pindaan seksyen 104"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 104(1)(b) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"103(4), (5) or (5A)\" dengan perkataan \"103(3), (4), (5), (6), (7) or (8)\". Pindaan seksyen 106"
      }
    },
    {
