      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/47/msa@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 [Akta 55], yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalam Akta ini, dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 21 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \" Basis 21. The basis year for a year of assessment shall constitute, period of in relation to a source of a person other than a company, a person other trust body or co-operative society, the basis period for than a that year of assessment.\". company, trust body or co- operative society. Pindaan seksyen 21A"
      }
    },
